109
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:45,860
 And then I realized, you know, hey, even though this has X-frame options set to deny, it doesn't matter.

110
00:09:47,060 --> 00:09:52,340
 And the same-site cookies are none for this, which was what we wanted.

111
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:56,100
 So it's still sending, you know, the cookies into the iframe.

112
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:58,980
 It's just not going to be able to show the result.

113
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:01,500
 But it doesn't matter for C-Surf because it's a state-changing thing.

114
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:07,120
 So, you know, what I ended up doing was just creating a bunch of iframes with this state-changing, you know, action.

115
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:13,520
 And all of them, you know, failed to load because X-frame options was denied, but it doesn't matter because the cookies are sent and the request is processed server-side.

116
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:19,100
 So I was just able to, like, brrrr, like, send a bunch of, you know, C-Surf at the same time.

117
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:26,040
 And I don't know why I hadn't really wrapped my head around it, but, like, X-frame options doesn't get processed, obviously, until the response is processed.

118
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:28,440
 And by that point, the C-Surf has already had its effect.

119
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:37,440
 So just, like, make sure, I know it gets tricky nowadays with, like, iframes and, like, fetch requests and stuff like that and what cookies are going to be sent with the same site and that sort of thing.

120
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:43,940
 But really, for C-Surf, you know, the thing you need to be checking is, does it have the same site cookies in place, right?

121
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:46,760
 You don't really have to think about, oh, is it iframeable or not iframeable?

122
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:51,080
 In this situation, I had to do it by an iframe versus fetch.

123
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:59,240
 But just keep that in mind, that, you know, X-frame options is not, doesn't prevent you from executing C-surf inside of an iframe.

124
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,100
