139
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:18,680
 And then on the third, you trigger the intent swap and preload the prompt in.

140
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:26,220
 And then by the time they're done tapping, you know, their finger is right on the send button for Gemini, and it triggers the exploit.

141
00:12:26,220 --> 00:12:27,560
 So it's kind of like click jacking.

142
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:34,300
